# Copy to .env and adjust.  `docker compose` reads .env automatically.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the weights and the KV calibration bias live.
#
# Point this at the directory you already use for the model, so the container and
# a bare-metal `scripts/serve.sh` share one 5.85 GiB GGUF and one bias instead of
# keeping two copies.  Relative paths resolve against this directory.
#
# The image itself contains no weights; on first start the entrypoint downloads
# the GGUF here, verifies it against the model repo's SHA256SUMS, installs the
# calibrated kv-mean-center.gguf the image carries, and never does it again.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
BONSAI2_MODELS_DIR=./models

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed if your weights are not named
# Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-PTQ1_0-mtp-lean.gguf.
#
# The name matters: the entrypoint looks for the canonical filename, and a
# differently-named file in the same directory will not be found, so it downloads
# a second 6.3 GB copy.  Either rename your file, or point BONSAI2_MODEL at it.
#
# These are paths INSIDE the container, where BONSAI2_MODELS_DIR is mounted at
# /models — not host paths.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BONSAI2_MODEL=/models/mtp-lean.gguf
# BONSAI2_KV_BIAS=/models/kv-mean-center.gguf

# The container's uid/gid.  Defaults to root, which leaves root-owned files in
# BONSAI2_MODELS_DIR when it has to download or calibrate.  Set these to your own
# ids to keep the directory yours:
#
#   BONSAI2_UID=$(id -u)
#   BONSAI2_GID=$(id -g)
#
# BONSAI2_UID=1000
# BONSAI2_GID=1000

# Which image tag to run.
#
#   stable                        promoted only after the image has been run on
#                                 real hardware; the safe default
#   server-dev                    the newest CI build, unvalidated on a GPU
#   server-dev-b11158-1-<stamp>   immutable dated candidate, for pinning
BONSAI2_TAG=stable
